&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;If you’d like to contribute to this project, reach out to me on social media or &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://christianlempa.de/discord&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;Discord&lt;/a&gt;, or create a pull request for the necessary changes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&#34;other-resources&#34;&gt;Other Resources
&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;ul&gt;
